														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1608799">
									

<p>Something about the entity getting out seems like it falls out of the scope of &quot;equal and opposite bad thing&quot;. It seems slightly overpowered.</p>
<p>Still neat though.</p>
<p>EDIT: On second thoughts, is Michaelson cured of cancer and his lifespan extended a good enough outcome to warrant the (probably really really bad) outcome of 738 pretty much owning him? How bad <em>is</em> 738 getting loose, in terms of an equal but opposite <em>good</em> reaction?</p>

